  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM training workshop TZA partners - RBM training workshop</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM workshop TZA partners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s att AIMS genomf&#xf6;r fyra workshops under &#xe5;tta dagar i RBM (2 dgr f&#xf6;r respektive institution) under perioden 14 &#x2013; 24 mars 2016 f&#xf6;r ansvariga forskargrupper/personal f&#xf6;r att de p&#xe5; b&#xe4;sta s&#xe4;tt kunna implementera sina aktiviteter och uppn&#xe5; sina m&#xe5;l igenom att anv&#xe4;nda RBM som ett instrument f&#xf6;r planering, uppf&#xf6;ljning och utv&#xe4;rdering av organisationens verksamehet. Denna workshop fokuserar p&#xe5; &#xe5;rlig datainsamling, resultatanalys och rapportering. F&#xf6;r ytterligare detaljer se bifogad ToR och budget (bilaga 1).
,</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this consultancy is to facilitate an eight-day workshop on RBM at for UDSM, MUHAS, ARU and COSTECH during the period 14 - 24 March 2016. This entails working with the workshop participants during two days for each institution The main objective/result is:  Reviewed and adjusted results matrix for annual planning/reporting, 2. Improved ability to collect data and assess achievements/failures. 3. Improved knowledge on how to elaborate reports. For further detail see attached ToR for the assignment.</narrative>
  </description>
